WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:00.266
I want

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568
to start in Ukraine

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.536
this hour, where officials say

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.271
the capital was the target

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:08.475
of a particularly intense air assault.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:11.011
Well, that barrage of Russian

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:14.881
missiles lit up the skies over Kiev.

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:16.616
But Ukraine says

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:18.551
it intercepted all of them,

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:21.021
along with a number of drones, Russian.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:22.789
Russia, however, claims

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.290
all of its targets were hit,

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.092
including a US Patriot

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:27.660
air defense system.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:28.194
Meantime,

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:29.796
the head of the Russian mercenary

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:32.532
volunteer group says an American citizen

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.700
has been killed fighting

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.068
in the eastern flashpoint

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:36.803
city of Bermuda.

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:38.271
Ukrainian forces are claiming

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:41.307
substantial gains on the outskirts there.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:42.809
See, there's some colleagues

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:45.211
joining us from southeastern Ukraine.

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.613
And I want to start,

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:47.680
if we can,

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.416
with a frightening night

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.184
for residents of Kiev.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:52.018
An attack

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:53.820
launched some from the north,

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.321
the south and the east.

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.657
This was largely a failure,

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:00.126
but it was a noisy night Tell us

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:02.896
what we are learning

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:04.998
about what

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:07.100
happened overnight and how that plays

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.002
into the trajectory of this war.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.537
At this point, some

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:13.339
Well, Becky,

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:15.008
I think the key issue here

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:16.176
and you put it in your intro,

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:17.310
very accurate, accurately,

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:17.911
accurately,

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:21.781
was the intensity of the attacks on Kiev.

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.316
This is a new tactic.

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:26.019
We have seen the Russians in the past use

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.720
mass formations

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.689
across many different cities,

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:31.024
many different targets.

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:32.992
Combining cruise missiles

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.829
and swarms of the Iranian made shahid

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:36.963
so-called drones.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:39.399
They're actually unguided, slow moving

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:41.334
missiles

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:42.569
This time, though,

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:44.737
there was a focus of attention

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:47.574
on overwhelmingly on Kiev

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:49.509
and the amount of time

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:51.845
that the missiles were fired

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:54.581
within was very truncated.

00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:56.749
This wasn't spread over many hours.

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:58.351
It was clearly an attempt

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:01.154
to try to find a chink in the air

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:04.257
defenses of the Ukrainian capital

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.825
by firing cruise

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:08.094
missiles, caliber missiles

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:10.563
to conventional missiles

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:13.099
and the kinds of the hypersonic

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:15.235
so-called hypersonic missiles,

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:16.503
all the more or less.

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:18.538
At the same time, that intent

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.473
there was clearly to try to overwhelm

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:21.641
the air defenses

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:23.409
and they failed significantly.

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:24.911
Also, the Ukrainians are claiming

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:28.214
that they shot down six Kenzo missiles.

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:30.350
That would bring a total of seven

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:30.984
that they say

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.318
that they have shot down now.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.453
These were,

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:34.420
according to the Russians,

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.955
supposed to be invulnerable

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.657
to conventional or traditional

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:39.692
or contemporary air defenses.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:40.693
Because of the speed

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:41.761
at which they travel.

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:42.362
But we're learning

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:45.331
now that they are actually not much more

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:48.434
sophisticated than many other

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:49.469
similar missiles

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:50.370
that are in the armories,

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:52.305
particularly of naito countries

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:54.474
that often hit hypersonic speeds

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:55.742
as they descend.

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:56.209
And also

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:57.610
their guidance systems

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.379
are pretty primitive to nonexistent

00:02:59.379 --> 00:03:01.047
so they are not precision

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:03.216
missiles in the way that a cruise missile

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:03.950
might be.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.251
We've got no evidence whatsoever

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.220
either to support the Russian claim,

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.022
the Patriot missile, anti-missile

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:10.456
missile batteries

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:11.691
were destroyed

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:13.693
in terms of the trajectory of all this.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:14.928
Becky,

00:03:14.928 --> 00:03:16.563
I think that what we're seeing here

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:18.565
is efforts being made by the Russians

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:21.167
to try to counterattack

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:23.803
and get inside the command

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:27.073
and control systems of the Ukrainians

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:29.175
ahead of their much vaunted

00:03:29.175 --> 00:03:30.476
ground offensive, Becky.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.380
Yeah, and that

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.181
ground offensive,

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.516
of course, is one

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:38.318
that we are anticipating

00:03:38.318 --> 00:03:39.619
and no real detail

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:41.221
being released on that

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.455
and perhaps understand the body.

00:03:42.455 --> 00:03:45.024
So the Vogler Group

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:45.692
playing

00:03:45.692 --> 00:03:49.295
a very significant role in this war

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:51.898
on the Russian side

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:54.601
particularly in the fight for back.

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:56.369
Now, the head of that mercenary group

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:57.870
claiming that a US

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:01.574
citizen has died fighting in back mud

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:04.310
What do you make of this claim?

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:07.180
Well, the Russian

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.414
mercenary group Viognier

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:11.251
has released the video,

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:12.719
which it purports to be from

00:04:12.719 --> 00:04:14.621
May the 16th of

00:04:14.621 --> 00:04:17.090
if it goes in its leader in Burma.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:19.292
But it's certainly in a town

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:20.760
that appears to be

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.362
the scene of some fighting.

00:04:22.362 --> 00:04:23.463
There is background

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:25.365
noise of what might well be mortars.

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:26.432
That's what we hear.

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:29.235
One of the soldiers on the front

00:04:29.235 --> 00:04:30.670
say one of the

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.972
Wagner mercenaries, rather,

00:04:32.972 --> 00:04:34.474
he's inside a building.

00:04:34.474 --> 00:04:36.242
He then comes across

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:38.911
the body of what he claims

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:40.413
is an American soldier,

00:04:40.413 --> 00:04:42.949
including the identity documents.

00:04:42.982 --> 00:04:44.617
Now, there's no word

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:46.152
yet from the US State Department,

00:04:46.152 --> 00:04:47.687
and obviously we would not be

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:49.622
releasing a name for this

00:04:50.757 --> 00:04:52.692
person until we have official

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:53.826
confirmation of who he is

00:04:53.826 --> 00:04:56.562
and what the circumstances were.

00:04:56.562 --> 00:04:57.830
But what's interesting

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.666
quite telling about this video

00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:01.234
is that he's quite British.

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:02.969
Prigozhin is quite respectful

00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:05.271
toward the dead soldier

00:05:05.271 --> 00:05:06.539
that was killed on the fighting

00:05:06.539 --> 00:05:07.774
on the Ukrainian side.

00:05:07.774 --> 00:05:08.541
Whoever he is

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:11.277
saying that he will be given due honors

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:13.713
and because he's assumed to be American

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:15.014
will be buried

00:05:15.081 --> 00:05:17.550
or rather covered with an American flag

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:18.284
and his flag

00:05:18.284 --> 00:05:19.619
and his remains

00:05:19.619 --> 00:05:22.355
returned somehow to the United States

00:05:22.355 --> 00:05:24.390
because he put up a fight

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:27.493
up until the last, Prigozhin said.

00:05:27.527 --> 00:05:29.595
So quite an intriguing statement

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:30.630
from an otherwise rather

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.799
contemptuous individual,

00:05:32.799 --> 00:05:35.802
perhaps I suppose not unconnected

00:05:35.802 --> 00:05:37.603
to the fact that he may fear

00:05:37.603 --> 00:05:38.805
that he could be returning

00:05:38.805 --> 00:05:41.007
one day to Moscow to face treason charges

00:05:41.307 --> 00:05:43.309
if the US intelligence documents

00:05:43.309 --> 00:05:44.277
are accurate.

00:05:44.277 --> 00:05:45.745
In suggesting

00:05:45.745 --> 00:05:47.280
that he allegedly

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.781
attempted to sell out

00:05:48.781 --> 00:05:50.583
his Russian comrades

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:51.951
to sell their locations

00:05:51.951 --> 00:05:53.853
to the Ukrainian US

00:05:53.853 --> 00:05:55.855
in return for a softer ride

00:05:55.855 --> 00:05:57.790
for his own fighters in parliament.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.258
Not that many months ago, Becky,

00:06:02.428 --> 00:06:04.197
some colleagues in south eastern Ukraine,

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:05.698
good to have you some time

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:08.768
there just after six in the evening.

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:09.869
Thank you.

00:06:09.869 --> 00:06:11.404
Well, decades after Rosie

00:06:11.404 --> 00:06:12.372
the Riveter

00:06:12.372 --> 00:06:14.307
became a cultural icon

00:06:14.307 --> 00:06:15.475
in the United States,

00:06:15.475 --> 00:06:17.043
symbolizing the working

00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:20.680
women of World War Two women in Ukraine.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.682
All taking on similar roles.

00:06:22.682 --> 00:06:24.450
They are increasingly doing jobs

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.753
Ukrainian men had to abandon

00:06:26.753 --> 00:06:27.887
when they were called

00:06:27.887 --> 00:06:29.789
into military service.

00:06:29.789 --> 00:06:32.825
CNN's Nic Robertson with this report.

00:06:36.729 --> 00:06:39.966
In a man's world, war is changing.

00:06:39.966 --> 00:06:43.536
Everything Tatiana is at the vanguard

00:06:44.437 --> 00:06:47.407
for shattering Ukrainian coal

00:06:47.407 --> 00:06:48.708
mining history.

00:06:48.708 --> 00:06:51.077
A woman on her way to work

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:54.013
a thousand feet underground.

00:06:54.781 --> 00:06:56.682
It's normal or it's okay now.

00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:58.284
Yes. Yes, it's good.

00:06:58.284 --> 00:06:59.152
It's good.

00:06:59.485 --> 00:07:00.853
If you wake up

00:07:00.853 --> 00:07:02.989
I thought you wanted to be a miner.

00:07:03.389 --> 00:07:04.223
Yes. Yeah.

00:07:04.223 --> 00:07:05.024
Your family,

00:07:05.024 --> 00:07:07.326
your grandfather, your father.

00:07:07.326 --> 00:07:07.860
Yeah. Yeah.

00:07:09.796 --> 00:07:11.864
She used to work aboveground,

00:07:12.165 --> 00:07:13.733
but when miners got called up

00:07:13.733 --> 00:07:14.467
to fight

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:16.302
and martial law cleared women

00:07:16.302 --> 00:07:17.837
for dangerous jobs,

00:07:17.837 --> 00:07:21.240
she jumped at a job deep in the mine.

00:07:22.208 --> 00:07:23.209
Was this adequate to you?

00:07:23.209 --> 00:07:25.244
As I always wanted to work here,

00:07:25.244 --> 00:07:27.413
but girls were not allowed.

00:07:27.413 --> 00:07:29.282
When many men were conscripted.

00:07:29.282 --> 00:07:31.451
The mine had to keep working.

00:07:31.451 --> 00:07:33.085
So to protect our country,

00:07:33.085 --> 00:07:35.354
the girls stepped up.

00:07:35.455 --> 00:07:38.691
She works six hour shifts, three days on.

00:07:38.691 --> 00:07:41.861
One day off earns more than previously

00:07:42.295 --> 00:07:42.695
and wants

00:07:42.695 --> 00:07:44.430
to keep her underground job

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.466
when the war is over.

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:48.434
My work is not physically difficult.

00:07:48.434 --> 00:07:50.002
I like it a lot.

00:07:50.002 --> 00:07:53.306
I would like to continue working here

00:07:53.306 --> 00:07:55.041
in this bastion

00:07:55.041 --> 00:07:57.176
of MALE-DOMINATED tradition

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:00.012
that may not be so easy.

00:08:00.613 --> 00:08:01.814
The other winners, though,

00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:03.483
I think when the war is over

00:08:03.483 --> 00:08:04.817
and we will win,

00:08:04.817 --> 00:08:06.519
I think women will return

00:08:06.519 --> 00:08:09.121
about the ground and the women's jobs.

00:08:10.089 --> 00:08:11.691
Yet even Chief Engineer

00:08:11.691 --> 00:08:13.226
Alexander admits

00:08:13.226 --> 00:08:16.028
without Tatiana and many other women,

00:08:16.262 --> 00:08:18.931
the mine could not have kept going.

00:08:19.966 --> 00:08:22.134
Around 700 of our miners

00:08:22.134 --> 00:08:23.836
got called up to fight.

00:08:23.836 --> 00:08:26.172
Our women wanted to help both the mine

00:08:26.172 --> 00:08:27.440
and the country.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:28.307
So far,

00:08:28.307 --> 00:08:30.710
46 women are working under the ground

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:31.410
alone.

00:08:31.711 --> 00:08:32.311
There hasn't

00:08:32.311 --> 00:08:34.981
been a general mobilization of women,

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:37.283
but plenty of traditional

00:08:37.283 --> 00:08:40.019
male only workplaces are finding women

00:08:40.353 --> 00:08:42.255
stepping up and taking jobs there.

00:08:42.255 --> 00:08:43.589
Before the war

00:08:43.589 --> 00:08:45.591
would have only gone to men

00:08:48.294 --> 00:08:50.296
Maria is among them.

00:08:50.296 --> 00:08:52.164
For the love of Ukraine

00:08:52.164 --> 00:08:54.400
and of her husband.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:54.700
Yes.

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.702
Now I know this theory

00:08:56.702 --> 00:08:57.870
but the practice turned out

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.106
to be a little hotter.

00:09:00.106 --> 00:09:02.174
She took up his blacksmith job

00:09:02.341 --> 00:09:04.310
when he got called up to fight.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.344
Last year,

00:09:05.344 --> 00:09:06.979
they bought the forge together

00:09:06.979 --> 00:09:08.548
a few years earlier,

00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:10.683
invested their future in it.

00:09:11.751 --> 00:09:12.652
But since

00:09:12.652 --> 00:09:13.686
this is my husband's

00:09:13.686 --> 00:09:15.888
passion and his life's business,

00:09:15.888 --> 00:09:17.323
I decided to support him

00:09:17.323 --> 00:09:19.625
to keep his job alive while he's serving.

00:09:21.227 --> 00:09:23.930
She shows me a video of husband Andre

00:09:24.063 --> 00:09:26.232
working at the same anvil

00:09:26.265 --> 00:09:28.234
Pre-War his artwork.

00:09:28.234 --> 00:09:29.602
Some Game of Thrones

00:09:29.602 --> 00:09:31.470
themed selling in the US

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.873
and Europe for hundreds of dollars.

00:09:35.541 --> 00:09:38.077
She is focusing on simpler stuff,

00:09:38.544 --> 00:09:40.746
ornate kebab skewers and.

00:09:41.547 --> 00:09:43.783
I very often cry in the porch here.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.285
My husband is defending us

00:09:46.285 --> 00:09:48.187
and that is very dangerous.

00:09:48.187 --> 00:09:50.289
But this work helps me to hold on

00:09:50.289 --> 00:09:52.592
and not fall apart.

00:09:52.592 --> 00:09:54.860
Women have been here before.

00:09:55.027 --> 00:09:58.698
Remember Rosie the Riveter icon of women

00:09:58.698 --> 00:10:00.733
at work in World War Two.

00:10:00.733 --> 00:10:03.869
She and others cracked the glass ceiling.

00:10:04.804 --> 00:10:06.872
More than a hint of Rosie and

00:10:06.872 --> 00:10:10.309
Maria and perhaps have changes here, too.

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:13.446
It's tiring work, but it's interesting.

00:10:13.946 --> 00:10:14.747
I would like to do it

00:10:14.747 --> 00:10:15.815
when I feel like it,

00:10:15.815 --> 00:10:18.351
not what I have to do it.

00:10:18.985 --> 00:10:20.853
Maria Tatiana,

00:10:20.853 --> 00:10:23.623
two of many who bravely stepped up,

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:27.026
no doubt more challenges ahead.

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:30.696
Nic Robertson, CNN, in a coal mine,

00:10:31.063 --> 00:10:32.164
eastern Ukraine.

